repomix-output.*

# ── Large source datasets ────────────────────────────────────────
# Removed from git history 2026-07-31; they were 129 MB of the pack and the
# runtime never opens them. They are INPUTS to the offline builders in
# scripts/, and the artifacts those builders produce are committed instead
# (app/data/*.json), each recording the sha256 of the source it was built from.
#
# To rebuild an artifact you need the source file back. Re-download from
# MoneyPuck and verify against the sha256 in the artifact:
#   skaters: https://moneypuck.com/moneypuck/playerData/careers/gameByGame/all_teams.csv
#   or the season-summary endpoints already listed in the calibration manifest.
#
# Kept in git deliberately: goalies_2008_to_2024.csv (1.5 MB) and
# teams_2008_to_2024.csv (1.6 MB) are small and drive the goalie work; and
# OtherData/contracts/ is hand-built and cannot be re-downloaded at all.
OtherData/HistoricalData/lines_2008_to_2024.csv
OtherData/HistoricalData/skaters_2008_to_2024.csv
